    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE GAMES FOR KIDS:</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The perfect educational game for fearless children!</h2>We recommend leaving the diaper on during play to be on the safe side. ;)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603130/extras/Halloween_puzzleplaysample.gif?t=1694538784?t=1699096541\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603130/extras/Halloween_Memory_Game.gif?t=1694538784?t=1699096541\" /></span><br>Please note that our game includes a reward system where children can collect stars by solving puzzles. When you collect 200 stars, another game is unlocked in which the children compete against a virtual cat (A.I.) in a memory (find the pairs) card game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603130/extras/Halloween_overview_Selection.gif?t=1694538784?t=1699096541\" /></span><br>Our puzzle game for children aged 1 to 6 was developed by educators and lovingly designed by our in-house graphic designers and features fun music and funny animations. There is a lot to discover.<br><br>If you want to surprise your child for Halloween, then get our fun children's learning game now.<br>Long-term fun guaranteed!<br><br>Your McPeppergames team",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The perfect educational game for fearless children!</h2>We recommend leaving the diaper on during play to be on the safe side. ;)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603130/extras/Halloween_puzzleplaysample.gif?t=1694538784?t=1699096541\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603130/extras/Halloween_Memory_Game.gif?t=1694538784?t=1699096541\" /></span><br>Please note that our game includes a reward system where children can collect stars by solving puzzles. When you collect 200 stars, another game is unlocked in which the children compete against a virtual cat (A.I.) in a memory (find the pairs) card game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603130/extras/Halloween_overview_Selection.gif?t=1694538784?t=1699096541\" /></span><br>Our puzzle game for children aged 1 to 6 was developed by educators and lovingly designed by our in-house graphic designers and features fun music and funny animations. There is a lot to discover.<br><br>If you want to surprise your child for Halloween, then get our fun children's learning game now.<br>Long-term fun guaranteed!<br><br>Your McPeppergames team",
    "short_description": "A lovingly designed Halloween puzzle learning game for small preschool children. It contains an animal memory find the pairs game that you can play against a cat as your opponent. For fearless children or you have your diaper ready!",
